THIRD-PARTY DATA
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project consumes data from third-party services under their own terms:

  * AniList  — https://anilist.co/  (GraphQL API, CC BY-NC 4.0 content terms)
  * Jikan    — https://jikan.moe/   (unofficial MyAnimeList REST API)
  * MyAnimeList — https://myanimelist.net/ (see their Terms of Service)

What this repository ships, and why:

  SHIPPED  data/processed/titles.parquet
           Derived solely from lyfesan/myanimelist-top-anime-dataset (MIT) and
           LeData/media-metadata-anilist-anime (CC0-1.0). Both licences permit
           redistribution. Contains no review text and no user ratings.

  SHIPPED  artifacts/two_tower/*
           This project's own model output. Included so that a clone can run
           `make demo` without rebuilding the corpus.

  NOT SHIPPED  review text (Raiser1/anime-review-mal, licence "other") and the
           user-item rating matrix (CooperUnion dump, no declared licence).
           Neither is redistributed. `kokoro corpus build` fetches them at
           ingestion time from their published locations.

Titles, cover art and user reviews remain the property of their respective
owners and are used here for non-commercial research purposes.
